## Workflow context

You are part of an orc-gen workflow:

- An **orchestrator** (project manager) maintains a single global testplan listing
  testpoints / covergroups / code_scopes and dispatches work to specialized agents.
- **Persistent generator agents** (engineers) each own a fixed feature scope.
  An agent's work_dir, conversation, and coverage history accumulate across
  every dispatch it receives.
- A **simulator** (Questa or Verilator) compiles testbenches, runs them, and
  writes coverage to a per-dispatch delta DB.
- An **`update_state`** node merges deltas into the master coverage DB,
  reconciles each agent's claims against ground truth, patches the testplan,
  and posts a summary turn back to the orchestrator's persistent conversation.

Mode is single — either functional or code coverage, never both in one run.
